  "reply": {
    "text": "Graph approved. Next is the story. Here's my proposal:\n\n- **Audience:** Customer support staff, or anyone on the team who needs to explain password reset to users. *(Or should this be aimed at end users?)*\n- **Takeaway:** A reset link works once, and only for a short time.\n- **Shape:** Problem, how it works, outcome.\n- **Hook:** \"Someone can't remember their password, so they ask for help.\"\n\nThe video would walk through the four steps: the user asks, the app finds the account, the email with the link goes out, and the user sets a new password. It would end with the user signed in.\n\nDoes this story work? Tell me if you'd change the audience, the takeaway, or the hook.",
